    "preamble": "Mansoor Alam vs State Of U.P. Thru. Secy. Deptt. Of Food ... on 9 July, 2024 Author: Sangeeta Chandra Bench: Sangeeta Chandra High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc-Lko:46472-Db Court No. - 3 Case :- Writ - C No. - 5916 of 2024 Petitioner :- Mansoor Alam Respondent :- State Of U.P. Thru. Secy. Deptt. Of Food Safety And Drug Administration Lk Counsel for Petitioner :- Shikhar Chaube,Akshya Tiwari,Saurabh Singh Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C.,Anil Kumar Tripathi Hon'ble Mrs. Sangeeta Chandra,J. Hon'ble Shree Prakash Singh,J. 1. Heard learned counsel for the petitioner, learned Standing Counsel for State-respondents and Shri Ajitanshu Tripathi, Advocate holding brief of Shri Anil Kumar Tripathi, learned counsel for respondent no.3. 2. This petition has been filed with the following main prayers:- \"I. Issue a writ, order or direction in nature of mandamus commanding & directing the opposite party no. 4 to consider and decide the representation dated 11.03.2024, as contained in Annexure No. 1 to this writ petition, within a short and reasonable Mansoor Alam vs State Of U.P. Thru. Secy. Deptt. Of Food ... on 9 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/70900953/ 1 time as prescribed by this Hon'ble Court, in the interest of justice.",
    "facts": "It is the case of the petitioner that the petitioner has already given an application to the Station House Officer, police station Nagar Kotwali, District Gonda, a copy of which has been annexed to the petition. The Station House Officer has yet not taken an appropriate decision, hence, this writ petition.",
    "arguments": ""
